  lockedText: Do you know how to cook? You're wondering about that too, huh? Well...
    yeah, it's you we're talking about, so one day you "will" figure it out anyway
    huh?.
  offerText: Of course you can... So, how about we try making this pretty useless
    piece of food look a little better? I can't quite remember what it's called,
    though...flying? fleeing? 'Frying', was it?.
  reminderText: "A shiny, oil-glazed red sausage with a nice crispy skin\u2014and
    of course, the most important part... a plate."
  exactText: No wonder everyone loves this useless little thing so much. Since when
    did it start tasting this good? Thanks, that was really delicious.
  extraText: Look at that, it actually turned out to be useful after all, ha! Thx
    bud.
